<p>1. Hai Yateem Ka Nauha , Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p>Dil Sukoon Paayega, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 2. Maar Kar Layeeno'N Ne Cheen Li Meri Chadar.</p>

<p>Hogayi Mai Beparda, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 3. Chin Gaye Mere Gauhar, Zulm Yeh Hua Mujhpar.</p>

<p>Jal Gaya Mera Kurta, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 4. Aapko Bulati Hu'N, Mai Tamache Khati Hun.</p>

<p>Haal Hai Yahi Mera, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 5. Be Kajawa Naqe Par Baandha Mujhko Zalim Ne.</p>

<p>Zaqmi Hai Mera Seena, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 6. Ris Raha Hai Kaano'N Se Qoon Mere Shaano'N Par.</p>

<p> Ab Bhi Zaqm Hai Taaza, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 7. Is Andhere Zinda'N Mein Kuch Nazar Nahi Aata.</p>

<p>Ghut Raha Hai Dum Mera, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 8. Pyaas Ke Sabab Baba Mujhko Apni Aankho'N Se.</p>

<p> Kuch Nazar Nahi Aata, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 9. Chaar Saal Mein Baba Mai Zayeef Lagti Hun.</p>

<p>Aur Kya Kahu'N Baba, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p> 10. Mar Gayi Kumail Aaqir Tang Qaid Mein Bachi.</p>

<p>Koun Ab Pukarega, Ab To Aayiye Baba.</p>

<p>Az: Meer Kumail Ali(Anjuman E Asghari).</p>